+
+    /// The `host:port` this client connects to, which is also the `Host` header it sends.
+    ///
+    /// A signer has to put this on the request *before* it signs: `host` is part of every signed
+    /// header list (`lakelet/4.21`'s S3-shaped implementation is the caller), and a signer that
+    /// wrote its own idea of the authority would sign a request the endpoint did not receive.
